        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See “— Regulations — Macau Regulations — Land Regulations.” Through MRP, we operate our gaming business in the Philippines through the Philippine License issued by PAGCOR on a property which Melco Resorts Leisure leases from Belle Corporation under the Lease Agreement.",
