        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105023",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have therefore developed and implemented a strategy that encompasses a governance framework including but not limited to regular staff training, data protection impact assessments and the establishment of policies and procedures which regulate the organization’s activities and aim to protect all personal data that is collected, processed and maintained by all business units.",
        "start_character": 144915,
        "end_character": 145295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105023-8289d065b2c46d55",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105023",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our gaming business in Macau at the properties leased from the Macau government in accordance with the terms and conditions of our gaming concession, or, with respect to the Mocha Clubs, in third party-owned properties.",
        "start_character": 40259,
        "end_character": 40489
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105023-8289d065b2c46d55",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105023",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain jurisdictions in which we operate have enacted Pillar Two, which impose a global minimum effective tax rate of 15% and became effective on January 1, 2024.",
        "start_character": 179469,
        "end_character": 179632
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105023-8289d065b2c46d55",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105023",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to special gaming taxes of 35% of gross gaming revenues, we are also required to contribute to the Macau government an annual amount equivalent to 2% of the gross gaming revenues to a public fund that has as purposes the promotion, development or study of cultural, social, economic, educational, scientific, academic and philanthropic actions.",
        "start_character": 158674,
        "end_character": 159030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105023-8289d065b2c46d55",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105023",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to the Mocha Clubs, we also operated the Grand Dragon Casino, which focused on mass market table games.",
        "start_character": 24755,
        "end_character": 24870
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105023-8289d065b2c46d55",
