        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we manage the top five floors of City of Dreams Sri Lanka under our Nüwa brand, comprising a total of 113 luxury rooms and three dining restaurants and bars.",
